WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:35.190 --> 01:36.780
Toru!

01:38.860 --> 01:40.160
Pakeratta!

01:40.800 --> 01:42.390
Haven't seen you in a while.

01:43.800 --> 01:47.390
I heard you were out sick this whole time.

01:47.570 --> 01:49.540
Yeah...

01:51.210 --> 01:54.940
A lot of people were talking about you.

01:54.940 --> 01:59.070
They all said you were bitten by a gray werewolf.

02:00.750 --> 02:02.180
Seems like it.

02:02.320 --> 02:05.780
I-Is it true?

02:06.190 --> 02:10.920
Well, I don't really remember what happened.

02:11.160 --> 02:14.860
By the time I realized it,
I was in bed with a fever.

02:15.200 --> 02:17.530
But you know Midori...

02:17.800 --> 02:18.860
Midori?

02:19.130 --> 02:21.570
Oh, he's the eldest brother in my family.

02:22.170 --> 02:27.010
Midori had the same scar as the one on my neck.

02:28.180 --> 02:31.870
But Midori never got a fever.

02:33.950 --> 02:38.890
Our Fox Deity, Crashes a Party

02:42.090 --> 02:43.750
Today's the big day.

02:44.230 --> 02:47.790
Maybe I should bring a present...

02:50.770 --> 02:52.230
Wh-What was that?!

03:01.910 --> 03:04.280
You must be the head of the Mizuchi.

03:05.350 --> 03:06.610
Whoa!

03:06.810 --> 03:08.210
I would like to have a word...

03:11.350 --> 03:13.510
How is it floating?

03:15.320 --> 03:18.850
S-Sir! I do not have much time!

03:19.230 --> 03:26.570
That is because I forced my way through the
defensive charm your Mamorime placed on you.

03:26.730 --> 03:31.640
I do not have much time left. My physical
and spiritual powers won't last much longer.

03:33.210 --> 03:34.510
Who are you?

03:34.510 --> 03:37.950
Oh, my name is Kiyomaro.

03:38.180 --> 03:43.450
I am the servant of the current
Miyabe family head, Miyabe Juzo.

03:43.990 --> 03:46.490
The Miyabe family?! You mean...

03:46.490 --> 03:51.360
Yes, Miyabe Juzo is Miss Momiji's father.

03:51.460 --> 03:56.060
I thank you for being such a
good friend to Miss Momiji.

03:56.160 --> 03:58.560
Uh, the pleasure's all mine...

03:58.770 --> 04:03.500
There is one favor I wish to ask you.

04:19.250 --> 04:20.080
Yes?!

04:20.560 --> 04:21.990
Oh, Noboru-kun.

04:22.220 --> 04:24.280
Come on in. I'm on the 7th floor.

04:56.260 --> 04:58.230
Welcome!

05:02.000 --> 05:02.760
Here.

05:03.400 --> 05:05.830
You didn't have to.

05:05.830 --> 05:08.240
But thanks! I love it!

05:08.240 --> 05:09.570
Let me put it in a vase!

05:10.040 --> 05:11.630
Anyway, come on in!

05:36.400 --> 05:37.690
Over here.

05:42.040 --> 05:43.830
Here is your seat.

05:44.140 --> 05:45.200
Go ahead and sit down.

05:50.380 --> 05:54.410
You smell really nice.

05:56.380 --> 05:58.580
Don't you have a little brother?

05:59.490 --> 06:01.510
That good smell is coming from him.

06:09.130 --> 06:12.120
The blood of your brother is the finest of its kind.

06:12.530 --> 06:15.090
If I drink his blood, I can become even stronger.

06:15.700 --> 06:21.540
But I doubt you'll call your brother
over while you're still conscious.

06:22.540 --> 06:25.440
I'm going to have to make you my slave, too.

06:27.980 --> 06:32.320
Just think of it as a little kiss on the neck.
It'll be over really soon.

06:33.890 --> 06:34.550
What's going on?

06:43.230 --> 06:45.630
My Noboru should be over there.

06:46.000 --> 06:49.440
Playtime's over. I'm coming for him right now.

06:49.940 --> 06:51.870
Just try to get here if you can.

06:52.210 --> 06:55.400
I like your attitude!

06:57.040 --> 07:00.010
Did you really think I wouldn't be prepared?

07:07.820 --> 07:10.260
Things rarely go the way I want...

07:10.660 --> 07:14.090
But this is how a hunt should be!

07:14.860 --> 07:16.420
Eliminate the intruder!

07:37.050 --> 07:39.140
Eliminate the intruder.

07:39.320 --> 07:41.690
Eliminate the intruder!

08:37.480 --> 08:39.240
Thanks for the invitation.

08:54.360 --> 08:57.420
You can't have Noboru-kun back yet.

08:57.570 --> 09:00.760
I still need him for something very important.

09:01.800 --> 09:04.200
You're strange.

09:04.570 --> 09:08.270
What could you possibly want
with a pile of dirt like that?

09:16.780 --> 09:18.650
That was a dummy?!

09:18.750 --> 09:23.120
You really thought I'd send Noboru somewhere,
knowing it would be dangerous?

09:31.700 --> 09:35.000
Can you fend off this many of us all at once?

09:35.970 --> 09:38.030
The number doesn't matter.

10:06.670 --> 10:07.730
A vaccine?!

10:07.940 --> 10:10.460
Where did you get that?!

10:11.570 --> 10:13.340
That's a trade secret.

10:16.910 --> 10:22.780
These mass-produced imitations are
useless during the most crucial times.

10:23.220 --> 10:25.650
I'll have to fight you myself.

10:28.190 --> 10:29.550
I'll accept your challenge.

10:34.200 --> 10:36.130
Hold on!

10:37.470 --> 10:40.200
Oh, did you wake up already?

10:44.610 --> 10:47.300
I want you to help Miss Momiji.

10:47.440 --> 10:50.000
Help her? You mean Miyabe-san?

10:50.140 --> 10:56.780
Have you heard the rumors of
gray werewolves lurking in this town?

10:57.020 --> 10:58.990
Yes, I've heard.

10:59.190 --> 11:03.590
That is the doing of Miss Momiji.

11:04.590 --> 11:05.520
What do you mean?

11:05.730 --> 11:12.170
All women of the Miyabe family will gain the
power of metamorphosis at the age of 16...

11:12.170 --> 11:14.900
...allowing them to become a sort of superhuman.

11:16.040 --> 11:19.970
When Miss Momiji bites the neck of another...

11:19.970 --> 11:29.750
Though temporary, she can grant them
superhuman abilities and also enslave them.

11:30.420 --> 11:34.250
In other words, Miss Momiji
is the host of an outbreak...

11:34.320 --> 11:39.550
...that is mass-producing those gray werewolves.

11:39.960 --> 11:44.270
However, for those individuals who
are not compatible with the infection...

11:44.270 --> 11:48.220
They will only contract a high fever.

11:49.200 --> 11:52.100
So what do you want me to do?

11:52.410 --> 11:56.600
Sir, please stop the tenko Kugen.

11:56.810 --> 11:57.640
Ku?

11:57.850 --> 12:03.480
The tenko will remove anyone or anything
that brings harm to you and your brother.

12:03.480 --> 12:08.890
In other words, it intends to kill Miss Momiji.

12:09.060 --> 12:11.490
But why would Miyabe-san?

12:14.360 --> 12:15.160
Sir?!

12:21.570 --> 12:22.930
The Mamorime!

12:34.010 --> 12:36.180
Let me talk to Miyabe-san!

12:36.580 --> 12:37.410
Miss Momiji!

12:37.590 --> 12:38.280
Kiyomaro?!

12:38.420 --> 12:43.150
Please stop this! Your father
is very worried about you!

12:44.230 --> 12:44.990
Daddy...

12:45.890 --> 12:48.230
Then why isn't he here?!

12:48.230 --> 12:50.500
If there's something he wants to say to me...

12:50.500 --> 12:52.570
If he wants to scold me...

12:52.570 --> 12:55.130
He should come back and say it to my face!

12:55.700 --> 12:56.800
Miyabe-san...

13:06.050 --> 13:07.840
I won't let it end like this.

13:16.060 --> 13:17.050
Miss Momiji!

13:26.700 --> 13:28.640
This one's rare.

13:28.640 --> 13:35.280
Yes, Miss Momiji was born with
the ability to turn into a Gold Wolf.

13:35.280 --> 13:36.440
A Gold Wolf?

13:52.790 --> 13:54.690
What a waste!

14:03.600 --> 14:05.570
Calm down!

14:16.820 --> 14:19.620
You look great like that.

14:22.220 --> 14:24.250
Oh? You want some more?

14:24.560 --> 14:26.490
You're the competitive type, aren't you?

14:26.630 --> 14:28.560
Very well. I'll accept your challenge.

14:28.660 --> 14:30.600
Ku! I said wait!

14:39.140 --> 14:41.970
T-Turn your eyes away!

14:44.810 --> 14:46.040
Why?

14:46.450 --> 14:48.810
I made it on time.

14:57.190 --> 14:57.890
Who are you?

14:58.060 --> 15:00.290
Glad you asked.

15:00.590 --> 15:05.300
Mysterious pharmacist and crepe maker by day...

15:05.300 --> 15:07.700
But my true identity is...

15:08.900 --> 15:13.600
The exclusive witch doctor
for the Overseers, Bekira.

15:13.940 --> 15:16.030
What do the Overseers want with me?

15:16.210 --> 15:20.310
We collect things that are
dangerous in the world of man...

15:20.310 --> 15:26.790
Based on what they are and their condition,
we determine and sort them...

15:26.790 --> 15:31.020
In some cases we will seal or even destroy them.

15:32.160 --> 15:35.750
That is what we Overseers do.

15:36.530 --> 15:41.490
So you want to seal me since
I'll bring harm to humans?

15:41.940 --> 15:43.160
I won't let you do it!

15:43.370 --> 15:44.810
- Bekira-san, hold on just a second...

15:44.810 --> 15:45.670
- But...
- Bekira-san, hold on just a second...

15:45.910 --> 15:48.530
The circumstances are special this time around...

15:48.740 --> 15:52.770
I won't bring any more harm to Miyabe Momiji.

15:54.110 --> 15:59.020
Hey! You were the one who
told me to corner the host!

15:59.220 --> 16:06.290
Well, since the reward for helping me is the
release of certain internal information...

16:06.290 --> 16:08.560
I guess I can tell you this.

16:09.730 --> 16:12.930
The Miyabe family is a patron of the Overseers.

16:13.200 --> 16:14.170
Patron?

16:14.440 --> 16:16.640
They're a sponsor.

16:16.640 --> 16:24.070
The Miyabe family has financially supported
the Overseers for a very long time.

16:24.780 --> 16:30.250
Everything I needed to work in this
city, including my crepe storefront...

16:30.250 --> 16:33.550
They were all provided by the Miyabe family.

16:33.850 --> 16:40.320
In exchange, the Overseers cannot intervene
no matter what the Miyabe family does.

16:40.530 --> 16:41.390
What?

16:41.700 --> 16:43.420
Still...

16:43.500 --> 16:49.400
I didn't think a member of the Miyabe
family would do something this vulgar...

16:49.400 --> 16:52.460
This is something a lowly yokai would do.

16:53.270 --> 16:59.480
You won't be sealed or expunged,
but you will be penalized.

16:59.480 --> 17:00.910
Do you understand?

17:00.910 --> 17:02.470
Y-Yes.

17:02.680 --> 17:06.140
She was trying to drink Toru's blood!

17:06.550 --> 17:09.610
That's reason enough for me to kill her!

17:10.390 --> 17:12.220
But that's not what you really want.

17:15.200 --> 17:17.960
This is just a guess...

17:18.870 --> 17:24.360
You only did this to get your father's attention.

17:25.170 --> 17:26.000
Am I wrong?

17:27.540 --> 17:28.510
But...

17:29.080 --> 17:34.610
But Daddy still didn't come!
He doesn't care about me!

17:35.020 --> 17:36.310
That's not true.

17:37.050 --> 17:39.780
Your father is really worried about you.

17:41.760 --> 17:43.450
How can you say that?

17:43.960 --> 17:47.860
If he didn't care about you, he'd just ignore you.

17:48.230 --> 17:50.720
He would never have sent Kiyomaro-san here.

17:50.930 --> 17:52.770
That's true.

17:52.770 --> 17:56.760
It is Juzo-sama who ordered me to come here.

17:57.100 --> 18:02.080
When I had collapsed, across the ocean...

18:02.080 --> 18:07.040
...it was none other than Juzo-sama who
sacrificed some of his powers to revive me.

18:09.220 --> 18:13.710
Miss, please do not hate your father.

18:14.050 --> 18:21.290
No matter how busy Juzo-sama may be,
he is always worried about you.

18:21.630 --> 18:25.160
There aren't any parents who don't
care for their kids. That's what I think.

18:26.630 --> 18:27.600
Do you really think so?

18:28.700 --> 18:29.670
Yeah.

18:42.080 --> 18:42.880
Noboru.

18:44.550 --> 18:46.920
How did you know how she felt?

18:48.520 --> 18:50.890
I just did somehow.

18:57.000 --> 18:59.990
Well, if you'll now excuse me.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.830
Hey, Bekira!

19:03.000 --> 19:06.870
The Byakki is in a very stable sleep right now.

19:08.810 --> 19:13.180
That's the internal information
you wanted, right?

19:13.410 --> 19:20.950
Isn't that why you set the reward as
"the release of certain internal information..."

19:20.950 --> 19:25.020
...and helped me so obediently?

19:29.930 --> 19:31.400
Toru would be happy to hear that.

19:31.830 --> 19:32.990
What are you talking about?

19:34.000 --> 19:35.230
Now let's go home.

19:38.610 --> 19:41.440
Oh, right. Today is supposed to be Christmas Eve.

19:42.980 --> 19:44.810
Merry Christmas.

19:45.250 --> 19:47.610
I know. Why don't we buy a cake to take home?

19:47.850 --> 19:49.840
Merry Christmas?

19:50.680 --> 19:51.780
What's that?

20:01.760 --> 20:02.850
Noboru-sama.

20:06.170 --> 20:09.570
I can do it this time!
I practiced using my own ears!

20:09.840 --> 20:14.270
I think everyone's ears are different!

20:14.270 --> 20:16.280
It will be all right. Let me do it!

20:16.280 --> 20:17.950
No, thanks! Seriously!

20:17.950 --> 20:18.740
Noboru-sama!

20:19.150 --> 20:19.540
Hey!

20:19.850 --> 20:20.410
Your ear.

20:20.410 --> 20:23.820
Looks like Noboru had a
year full of women troubles.

20:24.350 --> 20:26.090
I expected that since he's my son after all.

20:26.090 --> 20:27.790
Women troubles? What's that?

20:27.790 --> 20:31.380
Well, how do I explain this...

20:32.830 --> 20:35.160
I know. It's a kind of happy misfortune.

21:05.130 --> 21:10.390
Hare mo ke mo naku oowarawa de neboketerarenai
With all the commotion, I can't stay still.

21:10.930 --> 21:16.460
Kidoairaku gochamaze aa ijou
With emotions running wild,
everything seems so odd.

21:16.740 --> 21:22.270
Inochimijikashi toiunonara hara wo kukutte
Life is short so be prepared for anything.

21:22.540 --> 21:27.670
Iran kyoukai nanno sono yuke
Transcend that useless boundary and go!

21:27.750 --> 21:28.340
Kitsune Soba

21:28.720 --> 21:34.380
kingin kagayaku suteki na mainichi
With those bright days behind you,

21:34.550 --> 21:40.320
omatsurisawagi de mairouka
It's time for some merrymaking.

21:40.890 --> 21:46.730
Sora ni hi wo tomoshi tamashii no pareedo
Light the skies for this parade of souls,

21:46.900 --> 21:52.600
shiawase no kotodama hora kousa suru
The kotodama of happiness crosses paths.

21:52.740 --> 21:58.340
Namida mo wasurete odori odore
Forget those tears and dance away,

21:58.580 --> 22:04.480
toriaezu iiyone tanoshikeryasa
Forget about everything else
since we're having fun now.

22:13.330 --> 22:15.390
Misaki-chan!

22:16.730 --> 22:19.600
There's something I want to ask you.

22:19.770 --> 22:22.200
You like Noboru-kun, right?

22:23.400 --> 22:24.560
What's with you all of a sudden?

22:25.010 --> 22:27.870
I knew it!

22:27.870 --> 22:31.280
I can tell because I'm the same.

22:32.580 --> 22:34.740
I like Noboru-kun, too!

22:36.380 --> 22:39.880
Do you know how amazing he was?

22:40.450 --> 22:45.390
He jumped in the line of fire just to save me!

22:45.990 --> 22:48.230
You rarely see a man who can do that!

22:48.230 --> 22:48.890
Excuse me?

22:49.160 --> 22:54.030
Anyway, Misaki-chan.
Let's make this a clean fight!

22:54.200 --> 22:56.190
Let's see which one of us will win!

22:57.800 --> 22:59.570
I'll have you know that I'm really competitive!

23:00.540 --> 23:01.630
Uh...

23:01.740 --> 23:04.470
That's all I wanted to say. Bye!

23:04.880 --> 23:06.780
H-Hey, wait...

23:17.120 --> 23:21.690
I-I'm not going to give up so easily!

23:24.900 --> 23:25.730
Next Time

23:25.730 --> 23:27.370
Next Time
This is a tragedy for all maidens.

23:27.370 --> 23:29.870
Next Time
My weight increased!

23:29.870 --> 23:32.510
Next Time
I want a tight waist and slender legs...

23:32.510 --> 23:35.140
Next Time
By why are there so many things to tempt me?!

23:35.140 --> 23:35.410
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes on a Diet
By why are there so many things to tempt me?!

23:35.410 --> 23:37.440
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes on a Diet
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Goes on a Diet."

23:37.440 --> 23:39.850
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes on a Diet
I won't ask for more until I get thinner!
